            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Peach822"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Terrific flavor! We used egg noodles instead of fettuccini and a can of petite diced tomatoes in place of the fresh tomato. This recipe can be easily altered with, I suspect, great results. Next time we'll try adding some kalamatas and maybe some different veggies!",
            "datePublished": "2005-03-27T05:42:31.513Z"
          },
